WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:02.682
Ask the agent to walk through one valid inquiry, one

00:00:02.717 --> 00:00:06.049
invalid inquiry, and one storage failure against the spec.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.706
Where it has to guess, add the missing rule or label it as

00:00:09.752 --> 00:00:11.633
an intentional implementation choice.

00:00:12.074 --> 00:00:15.093
Check that acceptance covers the non-goals too: if

00:00:15.162 --> 00:00:18.285
automatic email is forbidden, a test or inspection should

00:00:18.332 --> 00:00:20.700
show that submitting an inquiry does not trigger it.

00:00:21.141 --> 00:00:23.986
A good contract helps the team build the agreed outcome

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.482
and recognize when work is still incomplete.
